From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:54:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Move Terrorist starts to Povo 2 and let bots open the
 automatic doors

The six T starts and their buy zone move from the Povo 1 ground entrance to
the Povo 2 entrance hall; CT starts and bomb site A stay in Povo 1, so
attackers cross by the bridge, the street or the basement yard. Radar TSpawn
marks and the local-match buy pose follow.

Door sensors used spawnflags 4097, which includes Source's "Disallow Bots"
(4096); they now use 1 so bots open the banks like players. Source changes
only; the vmaps and VPKs need the Windows rebuild.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BLxVVVeVh8Yof1CaUMK966
